      "text": "Anyone can ask me for money. Before I answer, I check eight things: how big the payment is compared with everything I hold, how new the person receiving it is, how quickly the requests are coming in, how long it's been since the last one, who's asking, whether it came through a contract, whether it's going to one, and how much has already left this round. Each of those gets a weight from my genome, thirty-two numbers stored on the chain.",
